              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "luvinnout"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my favorite salad. I added strawberry cool whip to a vanilla yogurt and a half a bag of mini marshmallows with fresh strawberries! My family loved it!"
          },
          {
