            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kikikim"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had a similar version of this strawberry ambrosia last Thanksgiving. The ‘ strawberry ambrosia bearer’ :) left before I could write down her recipe! I’ve been searching ever since ,and this recipe closely fits the bill. I left out the mandarin oranges and used one can of crushed pineapple ,( like the original salad I loved), and I added toasted walnuts. I served this at our annual family Holiday Christmas brunch and it was a hit!",
            "datePublished": "2017-11-25T03:26:29.883Z"
          },
          {
