            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "klevernick"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great salad to use as a dessert with a summer meal, especially a cook out. I used fresh strawberries instead of frozen and everyone loved it. This will be a staple throughout our Summer. It also makes a lot and would be good for a large crowd.",
